{
  "_note": "FU-BED-2 known target-size under-sizes on v0.3.0 (feba533). Each is SKIPPED by scripts/target-size.mjs with its cause, card and owner, but only at or above its pinned w x h (measured minimum over all runs): a known under-size that gets smaller fails. An entry that no longer fails prints STALE and is deleted by its card (HIT-PATCH for the component entries, Ember #27 for the fixture).",
  "causes": {
    "SM-BORDER": "em-btn--sm is 36px with a 2px border; .em-btn--sm::before inset calc((36px - var(--hit-min)) / 2) is measured from the padding box, so the hit area is 40px tall, not 44 (src/ember.css:43). Fix is FSD's (no visuals in FU-BED-2).",
    "SM-ICON-BORDER": "Toast dismiss is em-btn--sm em-btn--icon, 36x36 with a 2px border; the same ::before rule (src/ember.css:43) gives a 40x40 hit area. Fix is FSD's.",
    "TAB-CLIP": "em-tab is 44px but its bottom 2px sit under the tablist border and are clipped by .em-tablist overflow-x:auto (src/ember.css:120-128), so the hit area is 42px tall. Fix is FSD's.",
    "FIXTURE-FIELD": "non-shipped fixture theme; never registered in dist. The test-fixture theme exists only in stories/fixtures to prove the theme registry swaps tokens; its --field-height is 40px. Kept until R-2b deletes the fixture theme in v0.3.1 (Ember #27); the entry then prints STALE and is removed with FSD's restack. While it exists, the gate fails if the theme id appears in src/themes/registry.json or any file under dist/."
  },
